<title>USA: Louisiana-Pacific to close Texas plant.</title>
<headline>Louisiana-Pacific to close Texas plant.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louisiana-Pacific Corp said it will permanently close its Jasper, Texas plant on May 2, and offer outplacement services and severance pay to the plant's 300 employees.</p>
<p>The company also said it is &quot;making a strong effort&quot; to place as many of the employees as possible at other Louisiana-Pacific facilities.</p>
</text>
